771
00:37:27,340 --> 00:37:30,820
That d omega over dt is greater than zero equation.

772
00:37:30,820 --> 00:37:31,420
Exactly.

773
00:37:32,020 --> 00:37:35,020
The system inherently works to increase its own freedom and viability.

774
00:37:35,420 --> 00:37:41,020
That is honestly a deeply comforting and hopeful view of the universe, hidden inside a bunch of terrifying calculus.

775
00:37:41,220 --> 00:37:41,780
It really is.

776
00:37:41,820 --> 00:37:44,880
The universe wants to heal itself because healing restores options.

777
00:37:45,000 --> 00:37:45,400
Well said.

