00:38:32,140 --> 00:38:33,540
They actually fix the problem.

793
00:38:33,680 --> 00:38:33,860
Yes.

794
00:38:34,400 --> 00:38:39,900
The authors realize that organizing a curriculum by frameworks like having a separate volume for inference,

795
00:38:40,040 --> 00:38:45,000
a separate volume for memory, a separate volume for institutions, is pedagogically disastrous.

