00:39:38,740 --> 00:39:42,600
It is the code that determines physics, gravity, and the collision detection.

816
00:39:43,180 --> 00:39:45,960
It is the map and the walls you cannot walk through.

817
00:39:45,960 --> 00:39:46,600
Exactly.

