00:40:27,360 --> 00:40:33,440
This layer handles observation, inference, the loss of information, and epistemic ambiguity.

831
00:40:33,440 --> 00:40:36,700
It houses the entirety of the CLIO framework.

832
00:40:37,040 --> 00:40:40,700
So if layer one is the underlying game engine, layer two is the fog of war.

