It is the limited cone of vision the player actually sees on their screen.

835
00:40:45,740 --> 00:40:52,420
The game engine is calculating a million things off screen, but the player only gets a compressed projection of their immediate surroundings.

836
00:40:52,680 --> 00:40:58,980
And because you are dealing with incomplete information, you have to make inferences about what is hiding in that fog of war.

837
00:40:59,120 --> 00:41:00,440
Which introduces ambiguity.

