00:41:16,360 --> 00:41:21,660
This is where our missing primitive, gamma, the admissible trajectory, finally comes home to roost.

844
00:41:21,740 --> 00:41:22,700
Everything ties together.

845
00:41:23,000 --> 00:41:23,440
Exactly.

