It is entirely focused on optimizing paths through the admissibility space to maximize reachability.

850
00:41:45,500 --> 00:41:47,520
So layer three is the movement.

851
00:41:47,720 --> 00:41:51,300
It is the strategy across the board, based on what you can see through the fog of war.

852
00:41:51,440 --> 00:41:51,640
Yes.

853
00:41:51,840 --> 00:41:54,200
It is such a clean, elegant restructuring.

854
00:41:54,400 --> 00:41:57,660
It turns a chaotic pile of theories into a logical curriculum.

855
00:41:57,920 --> 00:41:59,960
The rules, the vision, the movement.

856
00:42:00,040 --> 00:42:01,660
It really is a masterpiece of organization.

857
00:42:01,920 --> 00:42:06,000
And within this restructuring, the Atlas clarifies something I found deeply fascinating.

