00:43:39,060 --> 00:43:43,760
They only see what is projected to them through LinkedIn, networking conversations, or job boards.

890
00:43:44,100 --> 00:43:48,180
Their view of the admissibility space is compressed and limited by pi.

891
00:43:48,380 --> 00:43:49,920
They are looking through the fog of war.

892
00:43:49,920 --> 00:43:50,320
Okay.

