00:44:21,860 --> 00:44:23,500
Based on the other three variables.

904
00:44:24,500 --> 00:44:35,880
Based on their limited view, pi, and their past experiences, mu, their generative model projects, into the future to calculate which career path will maximize their reachability volume.

