Yes. And it might find a hidden trajectory that reduces your inadmissibility that you previously couldn't see.

917
00:45:26,480 --> 00:45:34,920
That is absolutely brilliant. An agent is simply the continuous interaction of its boundaries, its senses, its memories, and its foresight.

918
00:45:35,120 --> 00:45:37,140
It really brings the math to life.

919
00:45:37,380 --> 00:45:48,460
It isn't just a set of dry equations. That is a profound philosophical definition of what it means to be a localized, choosing, suffering, striving entity in the universe.

