00:47:24,140 --> 00:47:27,820
But structurally, they are both networks of nodes connected by lines.

947
00:47:27,820 --> 00:47:32,960
A functor is a mapping between categories that perfectly preserves their structure.

948
00:47:33,080 --> 00:47:34,040
Oh, I see.

