00:47:51,920 --> 00:47:59,500
The atlas is hypothesizing that if this functor T can be formally constructed, it acts as the master key to reality.

954
00:47:59,560 --> 00:48:00,320
The master key.

955
00:48:00,320 --> 00:48:12,180
It means if you take the RSVP equations, the hard physics of thermodynamics and fields, and feed them into the T machine, it translates them and spits out the tension landscape, V, from sociology.

